    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d367-a1">

                <pb facs="0627" n="607" xml:id="pg607"/>

                <head>Mr. Welles to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-05-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 5, 1864</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    copy of a communication from Commander C. H. Baldwin, of the navy, in reply to
                    the protest of the master and mate of the British wrecking schooner Dart, which
                    was referred to the department with your letter of the 26th ultimo.</p>
                <p>I am, respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GIDEON WELLES, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the
                        Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d367-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d367-a1-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
